{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three ways to play:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to beat your highscore in <i>Classic</i> mode, race the clock in a round of <i>Time Attack,</i>\u00a0or go online for a 1v1 game against a friend or random opponent!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find your Push-To-Talk Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every round your Push-to-talk key is assigned to one of the green keys at random. Complete each scene by finding the correct key and speaking into your microphone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442890/extras/keyboard.png?t=1743683187\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How Hard can it be?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seriously, its just one key. Give it a push and say something. No, not that one. Not that one either. Come on, just say something already.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442890/extras/idle_centered.gif?t=1743683187\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Speak up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't just be pushing keys like that. You won't know if you've pressed the right key unless you're speaking into your microphone! Sing, babble, yell- Whatever it takes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442890/extras/speaking_centered.gif?t=1743683187\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HEARD.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Way to go! But it took you<i> how long?</i>\u00a0And<i> how many tries?</i>\u00a0You can do better than that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442890/extras/hats_centered.gif?t=1743683187\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Oh and there are <strong>HATS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock hats to customize your multiplayer character with by completing scenes and unlocking achievements in each game mode!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Keystroke of Luck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/0de9938483d17032913e24a0ce1ce688c03a9f31.jpg"},{"name":"One Minute","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/5f5a85c2ea1bb3ee35b20e6a6f52465d1ba43db1.jpg"},{"name":"30 Seconds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/61f3d35c77d9e430ca141f9a163e6d62f227b474.jpg"},{"name":"5 Seconds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/6876465b8b89ff0e3d4e6a81109c377c27c90e5c.jpg"},{"name":"100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/fc5da1110a6a420de60e102a1d827be71dbc46fb.jpg"},{"name":"50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/e3360fa55ee643b8cff84b9b33979ef61a18e58d.jpg"},{"name":"10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/ce641b3b37e107379cc147065b0f7b7bfed7bc84.jpg"},{"name":"I've Heard It All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/4b8faf72add61340a8eb389395b667f9e522839f.jpg"},{"name":"The 4 Second Rule","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/788bf0570f69fa5b058acad6c3ba86f5469f93c3.jpg"},{"name":"Gone in 6 Seconds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442890/6179a9de2c2daeeaa52897da35638fcad613d212.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442890?t=1743683187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743683187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442890/7aba9af08064e689e0ffa592aa8914a966da74eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17